<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5211] Setting zeppelin.jdbc.auth.type to KERBEROS didn&apos;t work</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5211</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;According to the JDBC Interpreter document (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/master/docs/interpreter/jdbc.md&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/master/docs/interpreter/jdbc.md&lt;/a&gt;), we should use&#160;&lt;tt&gt;zeppelin.jdbc.auth.type&lt;/tt&gt;, but It is observed in the JDBC Interpreter that:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Setting&#160;&lt;tt&gt;zeppelin.jdbc.auth.type&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;to&#160;&lt;tt&gt;KERBEROS&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;didn&apos;t work&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Setting&#160;&lt;tt&gt;default.zeppelin.jdbc.auth.type&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;to&#160;&lt;tt&gt;KERBEROS&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;In&#160;&lt;tt&gt;protected boolean isKerboseEnabled()&lt;/tt&gt;, we use&#160;&lt;tt&gt;getProperty(&quot;zeppelin.jdbc.auth.type&quot;)&lt;/tt&gt;, but in&#160;&lt;tt&gt;public Connection getConnection(String dbPrefix, InterpreterContext context)&lt;/tt&gt;,&#160;&lt;tt&gt;jdbcUserConfigurations.getPropertyMap(dbPrefix).getProperty(&quot;zeppelin.jdbc.auth.type&quot;, &quot;SIMPLE&quot;)&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;was used.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See also:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4029&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4029&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
